### order.created 발행 (정상 동작)
POST http://localhost:3000/produce/order-created
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "ORDER-001",
  "customerName": "홍길동",
  "shippingAddress": "서울시 강남구 테헤란로 123",
  "productName": "핸드폰 케이스",
  "price": 15000.00
}

